# AGENT.md — src/modules/

Frameworks layer. The outermost circle: pure NestJS wiring.

## Rules

- One file per feature: `<module>.module.ts`.
- This is the **only** place that binds a concrete repository to a core port.
  Changing data layer should be a one-line edit here — if it isn't, something
  leaked into an inner circle and should be fixed there instead.
- No business logic, no mapping, no request handling. Wiring only.
- Every module here must be imported in `src/app.module.ts` or it does nothing.
